#. macro: <split " " 2><string $gs1></split> — the last name of the player character (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: <string $gs1> — a text value passed to the string; value = global text 1 (the name of the player character) (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
msgctxt "quest/011/ComGrd010_01129:TEXT_COMGRD010_01129_VORSAILE_000_020:1"
msgid "Welcome back, <capitalize><if ($gn52 > 0)><sheet GCRankLimsaMaleText $gn52 8></if><if ($gn53 > 0)><sheet GCRankGridaniaMaleText $gn53 8></if><if ($gn54 > 0)><sheet GCRankUldahMaleText $gn54 8></if></capitalize> <split \" \" 2><string $gs1></split>. Word of your success has already reached us. I would guerdon you a measure of Serpent Seals in recognition of your loyal service."
msgstr ""

#. ja: これで双蛇党は、イシュガルドに恩を売ることができた。<br>君の素晴らしい貢献ぶりについては、<br>僕から統合司令部に報告しておいたからね。
#. de: Ishgard steht damit in unserer Schuld. Vorzüglich. Dein tapferer Beitrag soll natürlich auch nicht unbeachtet bleiben. Ich habe das Abaton der Bruderschaft diesbezüglich bereits unterrichtet. 
#. fr: Grâce à vous, les Ishgardais nous sont désormais re<shy>con<shy>nais<shy>sants pour notre soutien, et seront sûrement enclins à coopérer plus activement avec l'ordre des Deux Vipères. Je vais me charger de signaler à notre état-major la formidable con<shy>tri<shy>bu<shy>tion que vous avez apportée à l'image de notre grande compagnie.
#. speaker: VORSAILE
msgctxt "quest/011/ComGrd010_01129:TEXT_COMGRD010_01129_VORSAILE_000_021:1"
msgid "The House Dzemael knight spoke most highly of you─this will go far to improve the Order's reputation in Ishgard. Rest assured that your superiors will hear directly from me of your efforts."
msgstr ""

#. ja: しかるべき時が来れば、さらなる昇級も叶うだろうさ。<br>それじゃ、森の意志あらんことを！
#. de: Wenn die rechte Zeit gekommen ist, wirst du zweifellos befördert werden - daran besteht für mich kein Zweifel! Wir erwarten auch in Zukunft nur Gutes von dir. Kämpfe für das Wohl des Waldes!
#. fr: Nul doute que cela devrait vous être favorable, vous permettre de monter en grade. Que la forêt vous protège<nbsp>!
#. speaker: VORSAILE
#. macro: <split " " 2><string $gs1></split> — the last name of the player character (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: <string $gs1> — a text value passed to the string; value = global text 1 (the name of the player character) (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
msgctxt "quest/011/ComGrd010_01129:TEXT_COMGRD010_01129_VORSAILE_000_022:1"
msgid "Should you continue to serve us as you have done, I suspect a promotion is in your future. Stay true to the wood's will, <split \" \" 2><string $gs1></split>, and be safe in your travels."
msgstr ""
